		<name>Nellis AFB, NV (902 nuclear weapons)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<b>Weapon Systems: </b> In Storage <br>
<b>Nuclear Weapon Types:</b> 306 B83-1, -0 bombs; 186 B61-3 bombs; 204 B61-4 bombs; 206 B61-10 bombs<p>
The 970-acre facility at Nellis AFB, Nevada, northeast stores approximately 900 warheads in 75 igloos—“one of the largest stockpiles in the free world,” according to the air force.]]></description>
